{"slug":"soulja-boys-says-he-makes-100k-a-day-made-1-million-off-bitcoin-and-drops-albums-like-beyonce","postId":74307,"title":"Soulja Boys Says He Make's $100K A Day, Made $1 Million Off BitCoin, And Drops Albums 'Like Beyoncé","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":513913,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/soulja-boy-1-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-513913\"/><figcaption>Getty Images <gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Soulja Boy jumped on Instagram Live on Thursday morning to share that he will be releasing his new album 'BIG DRACO 2' at noon Friday. But, according to Soulja Boy, He only has two features on the album. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"BIG Draco Two at midnight, you know what the f*** going on n****. Stop playing SOD Money Gang N***. The album finna drop and I got two features on there. Everybody go get it on iTunes on Apple Music,\" said Soulja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"I drop like Beyoncé meaning no date, no time, and no promotion.\" </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/souljaboy/status/1461426336757522432?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/souljaboy/status/1461426336757522432?s=20\n</div><figcaption><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Soulja Boy dropping his album comes on the heels of him engaging in another social media back and forth. This time it is with Trouble from Atlanta, who called the Crank That artist out after Memphis own, Young Dolph.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After the news was confirmed of Dolph's passing, Trouble tweeted,</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> \"I like da lil silly shit soulja Be doin time to time, its entertainment, I get it. Dont Be no puss azz nigga an drop no song kalled “stretch sump” da next dayy as if u got active in my dawg losin his life dou!   Das ho shit luh Bruh @souljaboy an u kno wuzzam wit me.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/TroubleDTE/status/1461262085204054023?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/TroubleDTE/status/1461262085204054023?s=20\n</div><figcaption><br>According to Baller Alert, Soulja Boy released a song titled \"Stretch Some\" yesterday. It'll likely appear on his <em>Big Draco 2</em> album, which arrives tomorrow (Nov. 19) at midnight.<br><br>Soulja caught wind of the <em>Thug Love</em> rapper's remarks and replied in a now-deleted tweet, \"That song been out but what u wanna do nigga? U sound touch as hell on the internet fuck u talking about nigga.\"<br>In a second message, Soulja Boy mentioned Trouble directly and said, \"Police ass nigga @TroubleDTE.\"<br><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CWa-TrgF9zq/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/CWa-TrgF9zq/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>The Shaderoom also posted the exchange between the two where Soulja Boy tweets that Trouble could be next. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CWbLyOMrMVt/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/CWbLyOMrMVt/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In that same Instagram Live session, Thursday morning Soulja Boy shared that he makes $100K a day and that he made $1 million off of Bitcoin. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make sure you go get Soulja Boy's album 'Big Draco 2' when it drops at midnight on Friday morning. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Getty Images Soulja Boy jumped on Instagram Live on Thursday morning to share that he will be releasing his new album 'BIG DRACO 2' at noon Friday. But, according to Soulja Boy, He only has two…","publishedAt":"2021-11-18T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2021-11-18T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"music","name":"Music"},{"slug":"news","name":"News"}],"tags":[{"slug":"atlanta","name":"Atlanta"},{"slug":"beyonce","name":"Beyoncé"},{"slug":"big-draco-2","name":"Big Draco 2"},{"slug":"bitcoin","name":"Bitcoin"},{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"soulja-boy","name":"Soulja Boy"},{"slug":"trouble","name":"Trouble"},{"slug":"young-dolph","name":"Young Dolph"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/soulja-boy-1-1024x682.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/soulja-boy-1-1024x682.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":2,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/soulja-boys-says-he-makes-100k-a-day-made-1-million-off-bitcoin-and-drops-albums-like-beyonce/"}